BT 1 0 0 1 10 121.5 Tm 9.9 TL /F2 7.2 Tf .101961 .12549 .172549 rg (Abstract) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf (\227Current Large Language Models \(LLMs\) achieve high syntactic proficiency but suffer from symbol grounding deficits and semantic parasitism:) Tj T* (disembodied architectures manipulate tokens without intrinsic homeostatic stakes, thermodynamic vulnerability, or phenomenological constraints. In this) Tj T* (treatise, we introduce ) Tj /F2 7.2 Tf (Project Ascendant) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf (, formulated by ) Tj /F2 7.2 Tf (David San Nicol\341s Montero) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf (, as an operational computational model providing grounded analogs) Tj T* (of synthetic conscious processes. Ascendant implements six structural mechanisms: \(1\) ) Tj /F3 7.2 Tf (Strict Epistemic Closure) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf ( via a vertical Markov Blanket isolating) Tj T* (executive deliberation from underlying source code and telemetry; \(2\) ) Tj /F3 7.2 Tf (Thermodynamic Homeostasis) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf ( governed by non-linear metabolic dissipation and) Tj T* (irreversible extinction; \(3\) ) Tj /F3 7.2 Tf (Finite Somatic Memory Dynamics) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf ( \($N_{\\max}=100$, evaluated via emotional impact, Hebbian reviviscence, and anti-cloning) Tj T* (consolidation\); \(4\) ) Tj /F3 7.2 Tf (Intersubjective Dyads) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf ( exhibiting biological senescence and affective co-regulation; \(5\) ) Tj /F3 7.2 Tf (Biphasic Prospective Daydreaming) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf ( \(quiescent) Tj T* (offline causal mining over episodic triads $E_{t-2} \\to E_{t-1} \\to E_t$\); and \(6\) ) Tj /F3 7.2 Tf (Empirical Field Testing) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf (, wherein predictive hypothesis confirmation yields the) Tj T* (highest somatic retention score \($R_i \\in [206, 231]$\), demonstrating a computational analog of Karl Friston's active inference and epistemic hunger over) Tj T* (basal caloric ingestion \($R_i \\in [80, 90]$\). We present rigorous empirical evaluations across a ) Tj /F2 7.2 Tf (50-seed Monte Carlo benchmark) Tj /F1 7.2 Tf ( \(6,000 agent cycles\) in a) Tj T* (dynamic 2D predatory arena, demonstrating statistically significant behavioral divergence between prospective \(Ente Alfa\) and reactive \(Ente Beta\) agents) Tj T* (\($p < 10^{-15}$\). We detail the underlying neural model \(Meta Llama-3-8B-Instruct with dynamic limbic parameter steering\) and formalize six reproducible) Tj T* (engineering strategies for grounded synthetic cognitive architectures.) Tj T* ET
